Software Architecture

Core functions:
setup()
loop()
setupPCNT()
readFrequency()
pcntOverflowISR()
handleRoot()
handleData()
handleCSV()
logToCSV()

Main loop responsibilities:
1. Service the HTTP server.
2. Determine when the measurement gate expires.
3. Read PCNT counters.
4. Calculate frequency.
5. Perform scheduled CSV logging.
6. Print diagnostics.

Avoid long blocking delays during normal operation.

The frequency acquisition must remain independent of web-server workload.

Serial output should include:
WiFi Connected
IP Address
Time synchronized
PCNT initialization status
Server startup status
F1=10.0000 Hz | F2=9.9000 Hz | F3=9.8000 Hz | F4=8.7000 Hz

The design should support continuous unattended operation.

